~ battle_starter
[m]Would you like to start a battle?
- Wild Battle
	=> initiate_wild_battle
- Trainer Battle
	TODO
	=> END
- Cancel
	=> END

~ initiate_wild_battle
if GameData.trainer_party.size() == 0
	[m]You don't have any Pokémon to fight with!
	=> END
$>> OverworldManager.instance.start_wild_battle("MEOWTH", 20)
=> END
